es.go`, `callable_test.go`.\n- Key semantics: bytecode-only public `NewVM` → nil globalNames → identity index mapping; transferred closures keep origin's constants/fileSet/name space; `Script.Add` isolation deferred to `Compile` (needs `globalIndexes`); `resetTransfer` keeps `freePtrs` but clears `isolated`/`deep`; `maxAllocs` applies to Go-side calls; error formatting intentionally omits the script-level caller frame for Go-initiated calls.\n- Environment is offline (cannot fetch `golint`/network tools); `gofmt` used after every edit."}
